</span></td>
<td id="A6.T17.2.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:48.4pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Unanswerable</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.T17.2.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.2.4.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:113.8pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.2.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The topic of language for writers from Dalmatia and Dubrovnik… These facts undermine the Croatian language proponents’ argument that modern-day Croatian is based on a language called Old Croatian.</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.T17.2.2.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.2.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">Prior to the 19th century where did Croatians and Serbians live?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.T17.2.2.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.2.6.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.2.6.1.1" class="ltx_p">The direction predicts “answerable,” but the context passage does not answer the question.</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A6.T17.2.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A6.T17.2.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:62.6pt;">
