<span id="A6.T17.2.6.4.1.1" class="ltx_p">The Speaker, Majority Leader, Minority Leader, Majority Whip and Minority Whip all receive special office suites…</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.T17.2.6.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.6.5.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.6.5.1.1" class="ltx_p">Top 5 leadership positions in the House of Representatives?</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A6.T17.2.6.6" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_bb ltx_border_t" style="padding:2.5pt 4.0pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.6.6.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:85.4pt;">
<span id="A6.T17.2.6.6.1.1" class="ltx_p">The roles are listed, but the passage does not clearly frame them as leadership positions relevant to the question.</span>
</span></td></tr>
